{
  "_about": "Journey of one senior in the Jsem v pořádku programme (backend/fsm.py, web/app/js/fsm.js). send = a check-in call or message went out; the stage stays no_answer until the senior answers. Reply events: ok (also intents schedule_change and ok with a health note), need_items, low_mood, health_problem, emergency (also intent crisis), callback, opt_out; intent pause → event pause, intent human → event escalate (dialog.INTENT_EVENT). Human events: visit (contact plan: 3x no answer, the social worker visits), escalate, resolve, pause, resume, decline, enroll. 'new' is the state of every record taken over from the registry, so it accepts what any registry stage needs. escalated is never called automatically until a person resolves it.",
